WEBVTT

00:00:59.857 --> 00:01:03.601
So, this whole event
has been an elaborate build-up

00:01:03.625 --> 00:01:06.264
to me doing another one
for you, so here it is.

00:01:06.288 --> 00:01:07.775
(Laughter)

00:01:09.301 --> 00:01:14.976
Al Gore spoke at the TED conference
I spoke at four years ago

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:17.702
and talked about the climate crisis.

00:01:17.726 --> 00:01:20.797
And I referenced that
at the end of my last talk.

00:01:21.408 --> 00:01:22.976
So I want to pick up from there

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:25.050
because I only had 18 minutes, frankly.

00:01:25.074 --> 00:01:26.106
(Laughter)

00:01:26.636 --> 00:01:27.976
So, as I was saying --

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:33.000
(Laughter)